-threshold\n/Users/kristinarash/SecondBrain/Knowledge/library/strength-and-conditioning/block-periodization--issurin/claim--morning-resistance-training-no-decrement-after-6hr-rest.md:34:**When to apply** — Issurin frames this as an additional comment on sequencing resistance\n/Users/kristinarash/SecondBrain/Knowledge/library/strength-and-conditioning/block-periodization--issurin/claim--morning-resistance-training-no-decrement-after-6hr-rest.md:69:[[heuristic--two-a-day-workout-sequencing-by-dominant-ability]].\n/Users/kristinarash/SecondBrain/Knowledge/library/strength-and-conditioning/block-periodization--issurin/case-study--postactivation-potentiation-exercise-order-squat-study.md:52:sequence a moderate-load hang pull or clean pull before back squats at 85% 1RM, accepting\n_domain.md\nblock-periodization--issurin\nelite-sports-performance--evans\nfundamentals-of-sprinting--moyer\nperiodization--bompa\nscience-and-practice-of-strength-training--zatsiorsky\nsupertraining--verkhoshansky\ntransfer-of-training-in-sports--bondarchuk\nvelocity-based-training-implementation-guide-from-texas-am.md","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8874a695-d69a-4d44-9794-61e51bdfd55f","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:45:58.797Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"_book.md\ncase-study--bondarchuk-hammer-throw-block-mesocycles.md\ncase-study--concurrent-training-interference-and-decay.md\ncase-study--issurin-kaverin-canoe-kayak-block-periodization.md\ncase-study--klementiev-multiyear-workload-decline-with-podium-longevity.md\ncase-study--popov-aerobic-strength-microcycle.md\ncase-study--popov-competition-shortens-residual-effects.md\ncase-study--postactivation-potentiation-exercise-order-squat-study.md\ncase-study--sedykh-hammer-throw-explosive-strength-microcycle.md\ncase-study--sozin-canoe-kayak-age-14-15-performance-benchmark.md\ncase-study--troup-swimmers-maturation-timing-and-longevity.md\ncase-study--warmup-cooldown-injury-reduction-soccer.md\nclaim--morning-resistance-training-no-decrement-after-6hr-res