{"parentUuid":"6747faef-7a8f-4534-8161-0dcecd66969b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"624a8cec-33fa-4c0a-a445-c72ce718e6ab","agentId":"a07e06bc199bf998d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q5fmd1Np3xy4EMiBAV6Vg2","type":"tool_result","content":"# Choosing a Donor Sport\n**What it is** — The selection logic behind [[principle--donor-activities]]. The premise (Strafford et al., 2018): **athletes need to become versatile, adaptive movers before they can become expert athletes**, and attuned to affordances in relevant performance contexts. **Donor sports** share some of the same movements and affordances as the target sport.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f6167a77-9412-47d9-98cb-ce6de495d800","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:57:39.997Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Choosing a Donor Sport\n**What it is** — The selection logic behind [[principle--donor-activities]]. The premise (Strafford et al., 2018): **athletes need to become versatile, adaptive movers before they can become expert athletes**, and attuned to affordances in relevant performance contexts. **Donor sports** share some of the same movements and affordances as the target sport.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6747faef-7a8f-4534-8161-0dcecd66969b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
